# OIBSIP-Password-Generator
# 🔐 Simple Password Generator

## 📌 About the Project
This project is a simple **Password Generator** developed using Python as part of the **Oasis Infobyte Internship Program (OIBSIP)**.  
It generates strong and secure random passwords using letters, numbers, and special characters.

---

## 🎯 Objective
The main objective of this project is to:
- Generate secure random passwords
- Understand Python basics like loops, functions, and modules
- Use randomness for real-world applications

---

## ⚙️ Features
- Generates strong random passwords
- Includes uppercase and lowercase letters
- Includes numbers and special characters
- User-defined password length
- Simple and easy-to-use command line interface

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Python 3
- random module
- string module

---

